      "locator": "第 1 页",
      "excerpt": "Permitted2: [2-lane roadway] The bicyclist is permitted to ride in the center of the lane.\n0_Disagree; 1_Agree\nSafe2: [2-lane roadway] It is safe for the bicyclists to ride in the center of the lane.\n0_Disagree; 1_Agree\nBikeMoveRight4:"
